<div class="relative w-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-blue-700 text-white py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight">OWASP ASVS Assessment Tool</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-blue-100">
      A simple, open-source tool to help security professionals, developers, and auditors 
      assess web applications against the 
      <strong>OWASP Application Security Verification Standard (ASVS)</strong>.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="https://owasp.org/www-project-application-security-verification-standard/"
         target="_blank"
         class="bg-white text-blue-600 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition">
        Learn About ASVS
      </a>
      
      <% if user_signed_in? %>
        <a href="<%= assessments_path %>"
           class="bg-green-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg font-medium hover:bg-green-600 transition">
          Start an Assessment
        </a>
      <% else %>
        <a href="<%= new_user_registration_path %>"
           class="bg-yellow-400 text-gray-900 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg font-medium hover:bg-yellow-500 transition">
          Get Started for Free
        </a>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-16 px-6">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center">Why Use This Tool?</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-gray-600 text-center">
    This platform streamlines ASVS-based security assessments, making it easier to track and manage compliance. 
    Whether you're a security professional or a developer, this tool helps simplify the assessment process.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
      <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 2a8 8 0 100 16 8 8 0 000-16zM8.293 10.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 011.414-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Track ASVS Compliance</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Easily verify your application's security posture with structured assessments.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
      <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-green-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 2a8 8 0 100 16 8 8 0 000-16zM8.293 10.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 011.414-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Supports Multiple ASVS Versions</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Select different ASVS versions and adapt your assessments accordingly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
      <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-yellow-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 2a8 8 0 100 16 8 8 0 000-16zM8.293 10.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 011.414-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Interactive Assessment</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Mark requirements, add comments, and track progress with real-time updates.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
      <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-red-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 2a8 8 0 100 16 8 8 0 000-16zM8.293 10.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 011.414-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Open Source & Free</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Built for the community—no hidden costs, no subscriptions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-12">
  This tool is not affiliated with OWASP but follows the principles of the 
  <a href="https://owasp.org/www-project-application-security-verification-standard/"
     target="_blank" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">
    OWASP ASVS framework
  </a>.
</div>
